=Dear {{ $('Code - Merge AI Result').item.json.clientName }},

Thank you for submitting your claim to Fairweather Marine & Specialty Insurance. We have received your submission and, based on the value and nature of the loss, your claim has been flagged as a HIGH-PRIORITY matter.

A dedicated claims adjuster will contact you within 4 business hours to begin the assessment process.

Your claim summary:
- Policy Type: {{ $('Code - Merge AI Result').item.json.policyType === 'commercial' ? 'Commercial' : 'Private' }}
- Estimated Loss: ${{ Number($('Code - Merge AI Result').item.json.estimatedLoss).toLocaleString('en-US') }}
- Category: {{ $('Code - Merge AI Result').item.json.category }}
- Date of Loss: {{ $('Code - Merge AI Result').item.json.claimDate }}

If you have urgent supporting documentation (photographs, surveys, third-party reports), please reply directly to this email so it reaches the assigned adjuster immediately.

We appreciate your trust in Fairweather Marine.

Kind regards,
The Fairweather Marine Claims Team

